211 // PreAction hook: shared setup before any command executes.
212 //
213 // Onboarding is no longer driven from here. REPL-style commands render the
214 // Ink-based OnboardingPrompt themselves when no API key is configured;
215 // headless commands (run) check for a key in their own action and
216 // error out if missing. This keeps the input stack unified on Ink and
217 // avoids the raw-mode/Ink stdin handoff we used to have to do.
218 program.hook("preAction", async (thisCommand, actionCommand) => {
